{"id":"no","lemma":"no","pos":"adv","rank":19,"glosses":["not","Used at the end of a sentence as a sort of tag question or to emphasize a statement; isn't it so, right"],"ipa":"/ˈnɔ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/df/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-XANA000-NO.wav","examples":[{"text":"È un sì o un no?","en":"Is it a yes or a no?","words":[{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"yes"},{"g":"or"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"\"Hai un cane?\" \"No.\"","en":"\"Do you have a dog?\" \"No.\"","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avere"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"dog"},null]},{"text":"\"Vuoi lasciare un messaggio?\" \"No, grazie.\"","en":"\"Do you want to leave a message?\" \"No, thanks.\"","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"volere"},{"g":"to leave"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"message"},null,{"g":"thanks, thank-you"}]},{"text":"La risposta è no.","en":"The answer's no.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1001449","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"answer"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null]},{"text":"No significa no.","en":"No means no.","words":[null,{"g":"to mean, to signify","l":"significare"},null]}]}